docs {
  # Customer Production Status Range API
  
  Endpoint: `GET /api/production-status-range`
  Controller: `App\Http\Controllers\Api\CustomerProductionController::range`
  
  Autentikasi:
  - Header: `Authorization: Bearer <CUSTOMER_API_TOKEN>` atau `X-API-TOKEN: <CUSTOMER_API_TOKEN>`.
  - Token dicocokkan dengan `config('services.customer_api.token')`.
  
  Parameter Query:
  - `start_date` (required, date format: YYYY-MM-DD)
  - `end_date` (required, date format: YYYY-MM-DD)
  
  Format Response:
  - Mengembalikan rekap agregasi per part number: total target rencana (`planned_quantity`), total pukulan (`total_shots`), total NG (`total_ng`), serta perincian per mesin/jadwal harian (`machines`).
}
